        "original_id": "1aa02060-d3e3-5626-b649-bd8edc2be831",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Willie the Kid, DJ Drama, Lil Wayne, Lee Bannon\n- Products: DJ Drama albums, Dedication 2, Dedication 3, The Dedication, Never a Dull Moment\n- Concepts: Gangsta Grillz pentalogy, mixtapes, EPs\n\nFacts:\n- Willie the Kid is most famous for being DJ Drama's protégé and for appearing on DJ Drama albums.\n- Willie the Kid appeared on Lil Wayne's mixtapes Dedication 2 and Dedication 3.\n- Dedication 3 is the sequel to The Dedication and Dedication 2.\n- Dedication 3 became the third entry in Lil Wayne's Gangsta Grillz pentalogy.\n- Never a Dull Moment is a collaborative EP by rapper Willie the Kid and producer Lee Bannon.",
